// expect: exit 0
// Many senders through one router under every routing: each message is handled exactly once, by one
// routee; the messages one sender sends with one key arrive in the order sent; and the strings the
// messages carry, made on many threads, survive the collector on their way.
import avin.actors.{ActorRef, Router, Routing, RoundRobin, AtRandom, SmallestMailbox, ByKey}
import avin.threads.{Atomic, Promise}
import avin.threads as threads
import avin.time

data Job
  Item(sender: int, seq: int, text: string)
  Check(key: int, replyTo: ActorRef[string])

actor Sink(handled: Atomic[int], bytes: Atomic[long]) receives Job
  // The last sequence number seen from each sender.
  val last = Buffer[int]()
  var inOrder = true
  for _ in 0 ..< 8 do last.append(-1)

  receive
    Item(sender, seq, text) ->
      if seq <= last(sender) then inOrder = false
      last(sender) = seq
      handled.add(1)
      bytes.add(long(text.byteLength))
    Check(_, replyTo) -> replyTo.tell(if inOrder then "in order" else "out of order")

run(routing: Routing[Job])
  val handled = Atomic[int](0)
  val bytes = Atomic[long](0)
  val router = Router.pool(4, Sink(handled, bytes), routing)
  val senders = 8
  val each = 150
  val done = Vector.fill(senders, Promise[unit]())
  for s in 0 ..< senders
    val finished = done(s)
    threads.spawn(() ->
      for i in 0 ..< each do router.tell(Item(s, i, s"message $i from sender $s"))
      finished.complete(()))
  for p in done do p.future.await()
  while handled.load() < senders * each do threads.sleep(time.millis(1))
  threads.sleep(time.millis(20))
  println(handled.load())
  println(bytes.load() > long(senders * each * 10))
  // The router passes each sender's messages on in the order sent, so every routee sees each
  // sender's share in order, and keyed by sender, all of one sender's messages reach one routee.
  val answers = Buffer[string]()
  for i in 0 ..< 4
    answers.append(router.ask(r -> Check(i, r), timeout = time.seconds(10)).await().ok.getOrElse("none"))
  println(answers.distinct)

main()
  run(RoundRobin)
  run(AtRandom)
  run(SmallestMailbox)
  run(ByKey(m -> m match
    Item(sender, _, _) -> long(sender)
    Check(key, _) -> long(key)))
